			"text": "Narrow photographed leaf sprays adapted from the isolated forest-willow source. DesertPigment reduces saturation and slightly warms the foliage. SurfaceResponse gives dry, matte leaves with retained leaf-vein relief. The stem attaches at the bottom centre. This graph is separate from all willow and palm materials.",
